    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a leaf terrain cell in a spatial tree. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Leaf cells are the terminal nodes of the spatial tree. They store animals and resources and handle operations such as radius-based evaluations, registering edibles, and applying functions to contained entities. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
